      "start": 1700,
      "details": "<p>Neaition/Netum is listed as \"Noto\" in the BTCGI. Other sources (such as Manni 1981 and the <em>Barrington Atlas</em>) identify more precisely the area of Old Noto (\"Noto antica\" or \"Noto vecchia\"), northwest of modern Noto. The old town was destroyed by an earthquake and mostly abandoned in 1693.</p>",
